#: ui/voice.slint:864
msgid "OpenAI-compatible"
msgstr "OpenAI 相容"

#: ui/voice.slint:869
msgid "Tidying: Claude's Messages API, Anthropic's and the relays' and vendors' that speak it."
msgstr "整理文字：Claude 的 Messages API，Anthropic 自己的，以及支援這種格式的中轉站和廠商的。"

#: ui/voice.slint:870
msgid "Tidying: Google's Gemini API."
msgstr "整理文字：Google 的 Gemini API。"

#: ui/voice.slint:871
msgid "Speech recognition (Qwen-ASR, strong in Chinese and its dialects) and tidying (Qwen), one key for both."
msgstr "語音辨識（Qwen-ASR，中文和方言很強）和整理文字（通義千問），一個金鑰兩樣都能用。"

#: ui/voice.slint:872
msgid "Speech recognition: Doubao's Seed-ASR, strong in Chinese. A key from Volcengine's speech console."
msgstr "語音辨識：豆包的 Seed-ASR，中文很強。金鑰在火山引擎的豆包語音主控台申請。"

#: ui/voice.slint:873
msgid "Speech recognition and tidying: OpenAI, and nearly every other service that speaks its API: Groq, SiliconFlow, DeepSeek, Kimi, OpenRouter, Ollama, relays, a Whisper server of your own."
msgstr "語音辨識和整理文字：OpenAI，以及幾乎所有支援它這種介面的服務：Groq、SiliconFlow、DeepSeek、Kimi、OpenRouter、Ollama、各種中轉站、你自己的 Whisper 伺服器。"

#: ui/voice.slint:880
msgid "Volcengine"
msgstr "火山引擎"

#: ui/voice.slint:933
msgid "How it hears"
msgstr "辨識方式"

#: ui/voice.slint:934
msgid "As you speak"
msgstr "邊說邊出字"

#: ui/voice.slint:935
msgid "When you are done"
msgstr "說完再出字"

#: ui/voice.slint:937
msgid "The recording goes up when you are done: what most relays and servers of your own take."
msgstr "說完後把錄音傳上去：大多數中轉站和自架伺服器只支援這種。"

#: ui/voice.slint:938
msgid "Words show as you speak, through OpenAI's Realtime API."
msgstr "說話時就出字，走 OpenAI 的 Realtime API。"

#: ui/voice.slint:779
msgid "Telegram transcribes voice messages with Premium, or a few times a week without it. Your own AI vendor can do it too: Toolbox → AI → Voice input."
msgstr "Telegram 的語音轉文字要 Premium，沒有 Premium 每週只能用幾次。你自己的 AI 服務商也能轉：百寶箱 → AI → 語音輸入。"

#: ui/voice.slint:782
msgid "Voice messages have no AI vendor or model yet: choose them in Toolbox → AI → Voice input."
msgstr "語音訊息轉文字還沒選 AI 服務商或模型：到百寶箱 → AI → 語音輸入裡選。"

#: ui/voice.slint:818
msgid "Voice input has no AI vendor yet: choose one in Voice input."
msgstr "語音輸入還沒選 AI 服務商：在語音輸入裡選一個。"

#: ui/voice.slint:819
msgid "Voice input does not know yet how to hear: choose it in Voice input."
msgstr "語音輸入還沒選辨識方式：在語音輸入裡選一個。"

#: ui/voice.slint:820
msgid "Voice input has no model yet: choose one in Voice input."
msgstr "語音輸入還沒選模型：在語音輸入裡選一個。"

#: ui/voice.slint:827
msgid "The AI vendor's address in Voice input is not one FinchGram can use."
msgstr "語音輸入裡這個 AI 服務商的位址，FinchGram 無法使用。"

#: ui/voice.slint:843
msgid "Press the sparkle in a chat's composer, or type /voice in Terminal, and speak; press it again, or ⏎, and the words go into the box for you to send. Your voice goes to the AI vendor you choose below, under your own key, and nothing else does. FinchGram keeps no recording."
msgstr "在聊天的輸入框裡按一下 ✦（終端機主題裡輸入 /voice），然後說話；再按一下，或按 ⏎，文字就會進到輸入框裡，由你來傳送。你的聲音以你自己的金鑰傳給你在下面選的 AI 服務商，其他什麼都不傳。FinchGram 不保留任何錄音。"

#: ui/voice.slint:846
msgid "AI vendors"
msgstr "AI 服務商"

#: ui/voice.slint:848
msgid "Your AI vendors, each a name, an API format, an address and a key. Each feature below chooses one of them, and one AI vendor can serve several."
msgstr "你的 AI 服務商：每個都有名稱、介面格式、位址和金鑰。下面每個功能各從中選一個，一個 AI 服務商可以同時給好幾個功能用。"

#: ui/voice.slint:850
msgid "Add an AI vendor"
msgstr "新增 AI 服務商"

#: ui/voice.slint:851
msgid "New AI vendor"
msgstr "新的 AI 服務商"

#: ui/voice.slint:852
msgid "Remove this AI vendor and its key"
msgstr "移除這個 AI 服務商及其金鑰"

#: ui/voice.slint:853
msgid "No API format chosen yet"
msgstr "還沒選介面格式"

#: ui/voice.slint:868
msgid "The API your AI vendor speaks: choose one."
msgstr "你的 AI 服務商用的是哪種介面：選一個。"

#: ui/voice.slint:926
msgid "The language you mostly speak, which tells the AI vendor what it hears; words of other languages mixed in are kept as you say them. While you speak, a click on the language in the strip takes the next one."
msgstr "你平時主要說的語言，用來告訴 AI 服務商它聽到的是什麼語言；夾在裡面的其他語言，照你說的原樣保留。說話時點一下語音列上的語言，就換到下一種。"

#: ui/voice.slint:930
msgid "AI vendor"
msgstr "AI 服務商"

#: ui/voice.slint:931
msgid "Choose an AI vendor"
msgstr "選擇 AI 服務商"

#: ui/voice.slint:932
msgid "No AI vendor can do this yet: add one above."
msgstr "還沒有能做這件事的 AI 服務商：先在上面新增一個。"

#: ui/voice.slint:939
msgid "Words as you speak, through OpenAI's Realtime API; or the recording when you are done, which most relays and servers of your own take."
msgstr "邊說邊出字，走 OpenAI 的 Realtime API；或是說完再把錄音傳上去，大多數中轉站和自架伺服器只支援這種。"

#: ui/voice.slint:942
msgid "Choose a model"
msgstr "選擇模型"

#: ui/voice.slint:944
msgid "Volcengine's resources, as its documentation names them: choose the one you bought."
msgstr "火山引擎文件裡列出的資源：選你買的那個。"

#: ui/voice.slint:947
msgid "Nothing matches."
msgstr "沒有符合的項目。"

#: ui/voice.slint:950
msgid "Asking {0} for its models…"
msgstr "正在向 {0} 取得模型清單…"

#: ui/voice.slint:951
msgid "Add the key of {0} above to see its models."
msgstr "先在上面填好 {0} 的金鑰，才能看到它的模型。"

#: ui/voice.slint:953
msgid "Could not list the models of {0}: {1}"
msgstr "無法取得 {0} 的模型清單：{1}"

#: ui/voice.slint:954
msgid "{0} lists no models for this."
msgstr "{0} 沒有能做這件事的模型。"

#: ui/voice.slint:963
msgid "Tidying"
msgstr "整理文字"

#: ui/voice.slint:965
msgid "A model of your choice takes um, uh and repeated words out of what voice input heard, and sets the punctuation; it never translates."
msgstr "由你選的模型去掉語音輸入聽到的「嗯」「呃」這類贅詞和重複的字詞，並加上標點；它從不翻譯。"

#: ui/voice.slint:967
msgid "Transcribe voice messages with your AI vendor"
msgstr "用你的 AI 服務商把語音訊息轉文字"

#: ui/voice.slint:969
msgid "Transcribe under a voice message then sends it to the AI vendor chosen here instead of Telegram: someone else's voice, to a service of your choosing. The words are kept nowhere. Off unless you turn it on."
msgstr "打開後，語音訊息下面的「轉文字」不再交給 Telegram，而是傳給這裡選的 AI 服務商：也就是把別人的聲音傳給你選的服務。轉出來的字哪裡都不保存。預設關閉。"

#: ui/voice.slint:914
msgid "Its name, the API it speaks, its address and your key. Nothing is kept until you save."
msgstr "名稱、它用的介面、位址和你的金鑰。按「儲存」之前，什麼都不會記下。"

#: ui/voice.slint:916
msgid "Leave it empty to keep this key."
msgstr "留空就保留目前的金鑰。"

#: ui/voice.slint:917
msgid "Remove the key"
msgstr "移除金鑰"

#: ui/voice.slint:918
msgid "The key goes when you save."
msgstr "儲存時會移除這個金鑰。"

#: ui/voice.slint:919
msgid "Keep the key"
msgstr "保留金鑰"
